<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>UniGuide - University Admissions</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
    <script src="script.js" defer></script>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <nav>
        <h2>🎓 UniGuide</h2>

        <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="#home">Home</a>
            <a href="#courses">Courses</a>
            <a href="#admission">Admission</a>
            <a href="#dates">Dates</a>
            <a href="#faq">FAQs</a>
        </div>
    </nav>
</header>

<section class="hero" id="home">
    <h1>Shape Your Future With Us</h1>
    <p>Discover opportunities. Learn new skills. Build your career.</p>
    <a href="#application" class="btn">Apply Now</a>
</section>

<section id="courses">
    <h2>Our Popular Courses</h2>

    <div class="container">

        <div class="card">
            <h3>B.Tech Computer Science</h3>
            <p>Duration: 4 Years</p>
            <p>Fees: ₹1,20,000 / Year</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>BBA</h3>
            <p>Duration: 3 Years</p>
            <p>Fees: ₹80,000 / Year</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>B.Sc Data Science</h3>
            <p>Duration: 3 Years</p>
            <p>Fees: ₹90,000 / Year</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>BCA</h3>
            <p>Duration: 3 Years</p>
            <p>Fees: ₹75,000 / Year</p>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>

<section id="eligibility">
    <h2>Eligibility Criteria</h2>
    <div class="info">
        <p>✔ Candidates must have completed 10+2.</p>
        <p>✔ Minimum 50% marks in qualifying examinations.</p>
        <p>✔ Science stream required for selected technical courses.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="admission">
    <h2>Admission Process</h2>

    <div class="info">
        <p>1. Choose your preferred course.</p>
        <p>2. Check eligibility criteria.</p>
        <p>3. Fill out the online application form.</p>
        <p>4. Submit the required documents.</p>
        <p>5. Wait for admission confirmation.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="dates">
    <h2>Important Dates</h2>

    <div class="info">
        <p>Application Start: 1 January 2027</p>
        <p>Last Date: 30 April 2027</p>
        <p>Admission Results: 15 May 2027</p>
        <p>Classes Begin: 1 July 2027</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="application">
    <h2>Online Application Form</h2>

    <form id="admissionForm">

        <input type="text" id="name"
        placeholder="Full Name" required>

        <input type="email" id="email"
        placeholder="Email Address" required>

        <input type="tel" id="phone"
        placeholder="Phone Number" pattern="[0-9]{10}" required>

        <select id="course" required>
            <option value="">Select Course</option>
            <option>B.Tech Computer Science</option>
            <option>BBA</option>
            <option>B.Sc Data Science</option>
            <option>BCA</option>
        </select>

        <input type="number" id="marks"
        placeholder="12th Percentage" min="0" max="100" required>

        <button type="submit">Submit Application</button>

    </form>

    <p id="message"></p>
</section>

<section id="faq">
    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

    <div class="info">
        <h3>1. How can I apply?</h3>
        <p>Fill out the online application form.</p>

        <h3>2. Are scholarships available?</h3>
        <p>Scholarships may be available for eligible students.</p>

        <h3>3. Can I apply for multiple courses?</h3>
        <p>Contact the admissions office for course selection details.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<footer>
    <p>© 2027 UniGuide University. All Rights Reserved.</p>
    <p>Designed by Hemanth Venkat</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
